$DATUM (E)-N'-(3-Cyano-5-(3,5-dimethylisoxazo4-yl)pyridin-2-yl)-N,N-dimethylformimidamide
(21n, R4 = R6 = H, R5 = 3,5- Dimethylisoxazo4-yl). The product was
obtained as a yellow solid (74.5 mg, 70%). Pd-catalyzed cross coupling of
20a or 20b with various boronic acids or boronate esters under typical
Suzuki conditions proceeded in good yield (avee yields of 45−70%). 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 8.64 (s, 1H), 8.24 (d, J = 2.4 Hz, 1H), 7.67 (d, J =
2.5 Hz, 1H), 3.22 (s, 3H), 3.18 (s, 3H), 2.41 (s, 3H), 2.26 (s, 3H). MS
[ESI+] m/z: 270.13 [M + H+]+.
