$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 4-Amino-5-(furan-2-yl)-2-methyl-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[ 2,3-d]pyrimidine (9a). An argon-purged
mixture of 26 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol), furan-2-boronic acid (126 mg, 1.125
mmol), Na2CO3 (239 mg, 2.25 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (8 mg, 0.036 mmol), and TPPTS
(53 mg, 0.093 mmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3
h. After cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and
concentrated to dryness in vacuo, and the residue was purified by reverse
phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100% MeOH in water) to afford product 9a as a beige
solid, which was crystallized from water/MeOH. 4-Amino-2-methyl-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-5-(thiophen-2-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (9c).
Compound 9c was prepared as described for 9a from 26 (302 mg, 0.74 mmol)
and thiophene-2-boronic acid as tan solid (189 mg, 70%), which was
crystallized from water/MeOH to give tan needles. Mp 155-157 °C. [α ]D
-54.6 (c 0.295, DMSO). 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 2.41 (s, 3H, CH3); 3.54
(ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ a,OH = 6.7 Hz, J5´ a,4´ = 3.5 Hz, H-5´a);
3.62 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ b,OH = 4.6 Hz, J5´ b,4´ = 3.7 Hz,
H-5´b); 3.91 (td, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´ ,5´b = 3.6 Hz, J4´ ,3´ = 2.7 Hz,
H-4´); 4.09 (td, 1H, J3´ ,2´ = J3´,OH = 4.8 Hz, J3´ ,4´ = 2.7 Hz, H-3');
4.49 (td, 1H, J2´ ,1´ = J2´,OH = 6.6 Hz, J2´ ,3´ = 5.1 Hz, H-2'); 5.14
(d, 1H, JOH,3´ = 4.5 Hz, OH-3´); 5.31 (d, 1H, JOH,2´ = 6.6 Hz, OH-2´);
5.36 (dd, 1H, JOH,5´a = 6.7 Hz, JOH,5´b = 4.7 Hz, OH-5´); 6.04 (d, 1H,
J1´,2´ = 6.7 Hz, H-1'); 6.28 (bs, 2H, NH2); 7.13 (dd, 1H, J3,4 = 3.5 Hz,
J3,5 = 1.2 Hz, H-3-thienyl); 7.17 (dd, 1H, J4,5 = 5.2 Hz, J4,3 = 3.5 Hz,
H-4-thienyl); 7.51 (s, 1H, H-6); 7.55 (dd, 1H, J5,4 = 5.2 Hz, J5,3 = 1.2
Hz, H-5-thienyl). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 25.39 (CH3); 62.02
(CH2-5´); 71.04 (CH-3'); 73.69 (CH-2'); 85.61 (CH-4´); 87.28 (CH-1´);
98.85 (C-4a); 108.52 (C-5); 121.92 (CH-6); 125.85 (CH-5-thienyl); 126.32
(CH-3-thienyl); 128.47 (CH-4-thienyl); 135.96 (C-2-thienyl); 151.70
(C-7a); 157.34 (C-4); 160.77 (C-2). IR (ATR): ν 1637, 1622, 1552, 1465,
1418, 1309, 1130, 1079, 1055, 1031, 1004, 792, 709, 607 cm-1. MS (ESI)
m/z 363 (M+H), 385 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C16H19N4O4S [M+H] calcd:
363.11215; found: 363.11092. Anal. (C16H18N4O4S•1.2H2O): C, H, N.
