$DATUM 1-(4-Methoxyphenyl)-1-(3-thienylquinazoline-4-yl)ethanol (31). Under an
atmosphere of argon, the mixture of 17 (62mg, 0.2 mmol), 3-thienylboroic
acid (38 mg, 0.3 mmol), potassium carbonate (55 mg, 0.2 mmol), palladium
acetate (23 mg, 0.01 mmol), and 1,1'-bis(di-tert-butylphosphino)ferrocene
(4.8 mg, 0.01 mmol) in 1,4-dioxane (10 mL) was refluxed for 8 h. The
reaction mixture was evaporated. The residue was purified with column
chromatography. 31 (50.4 mg, 0.14 mmol, 70%). 1H-NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ:
8.50 (1H, dd, J = 3.5, 1.0 Hz), 8.11 (1H, dd, J = 5.0, 1.0 Hz), 8.04 (1H,
d, J = 8.0 Hz), 7.77-7.73 (1H, m), 7.68 (1H, d, J = 8.5 Hz), 7.47 (1H,
dd, J = 5.0, 3.5 Hz), 7.35 (2H, d, J = 8.5 Hz), 7.32-7.28 (1H, m), 6.85
(2H, d, J = 8.5 Hz), 6.67 (1H, s), 3.78 (4H, s), 2.14 (3H, s). 13C-NMR
(76 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 172.62, 158.99, 155.00, 152.05, 141.28, 137.43,
133.47, 129.33, 128.48, 127.76, 127.59, 126.59, 126.50, 126.31, 119.59,
113.97, 74.85, 55.24, 28.56. HRMS (FAB) m/z Calcd for C21H19N2O2S (M+1):
363.1168, Found: 363.1169. IR (ATR): 3257 cm-1.
